msgctxt "140"
msgid "Owww..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Sorry, just a little more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Huh? What's goin' on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Looks like Mitsuo didn't need your help after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Not like your suggestion was any better..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Did you say something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Nope, nothing at all! Haha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"By the way, Rikiya. You should probably go grab your bags.\r\n"
"Our flight's pretty soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Huh? Shit on a stick, you're right! Lemme head home real\r\n"
"quick, and I'll be back before you know it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "See you in a bit, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "(Sorry, Rikiya.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "(This has to be a one-man job.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"(I hope Mitsuo's okay. My best bet would be to head downtown\r\n"
"and see if I can head him off.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Rikiya. What are you doing over here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Well, you said we were gonna be shippin' up to Kamurocho\r\n"
"tonight, but I realized we never agreed on a time! Figured\r\n"
"I'd stop by and check with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Oh, uh... The flight'll be at 8, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"You guess? Shouldn't you have booked by now? And hey,\r\n"
"that's pretty late! We're not gonna get into Tokyo 'til 11!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "That's fine. Kamurocho never sleeps, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"Good point, Aniki! Oh, and I'm all packed and ready to go.\r\n"
"This trip's gonna be great!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "We're not going to have fun, Rikiya. This is all business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"Yeah, yeah, I know. Anyways, we got some time 'til we\r\n"
"gotta head out for the 8 o'clock flight. Guess I'll just\r\n"
"chill here for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Right, uh... Good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "By the way, Aniki. Take a gander over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Mitsuo and Riona? What about them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Someone's got a mean case of young love, if you catch me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "I'm not sure I do \"catch you.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Just watch, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Hey, Riona!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "You know Okada from school?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"His dad's like, mega-rich! Apparently he owns three whole\r\n"
"movie theaters in town! Did you know that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"Oh. Well anyway, me and Okada were talking and he gave me\r\n"
"two free tickets for a movie at one of his dad's theaters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Uh-huh. Are you sure you didn't beat the tickets out of him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "What? Of course not!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Yeah. Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"Anyway, it turns out those tickets're only good until today!\r\n"
"Can you believe it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "I'm outta luck if I don't go now. What should I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Um. Just go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Well... I wanna, but none of my friends can do it today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Huh. Can't you just go alone, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "But... Riona!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Will you go with me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "Sorry, I have plans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Huh? What kinda plans!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"Don't you have a movie to get to? Maybe Shiro or one of\r\n"
"the other guys would wanna go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Oh, um... yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Ouchie wowchie. That's gotta hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Not surprising with those clothes, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Not sure you're one to be critiquing fashion, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"Oh c'mon! Just look at this luscious hair! Not a single\r\n"
"strand outta place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Yeah, because it's one solid block."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "Hold up, Aniki. Do you... not like how I look?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Eh, whatever. Guess you're just behind the times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "Excuse me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "You gotta accept that fashions change, old-timer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "I know more about fashion than you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid ""
"Suuure you do, Aniki. Hey, why don't we have a little\r\n"
"friendly contest? Y'know, see who's really got the best\r\n"
"taste?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "A fashion contest, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "I'm gonna make you regret challenging me, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Heh, sure you are, Aniki. Sure you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "Sounds childish to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid "What's the matter, Aniki? You chicken? Bok bok bok!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"...Fine, I'll do it. I'm gonna make you regret ever\r\n"
"challenging me, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "Heh, famous last words."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid ""
"All right, here come the rules. Each of us is gonna pick\r\n"
"out some stuff to really make Mitsuo's style pop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "One clothin' item and one accessory, got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid ""
"Good, then let's regroup back here when we've got 'em.\r\n"
"I'm gonna whoop your ass to high heaven, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid ""
"(How do I always end up agreeing to these absurd requests?\r\n"
"I do want to help Mitsuo, though. I guess I'll play along.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "You're gonna regret this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Sounds childish."
msgstr ""

